Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.clips,{"deedee|Not today, honey. Book club at four. We're reading the same book as last month. Nobody finished it.":"","boppy|A library? I read a book once. 1974. It was about fish. It wasn't accurate.":"","deedee|Not yet, honey. I'm still deciding on earrings. Come back with the invitation.":"","boppy|Not yet. I'm still looking for the tie. I have one tie.":"","boppy|An airport? At midnight? I'm still recovering from the tie.":"","deedee|Not this time, honey. Somebody has to start Sunday dinner. Every clock in my kitchen says midnight and the roast doesn't care.":"","sal|Where to? The airport? It's always the airport.":"","sal|Okay. I'll be here. In traffic.":"","sal|Where to? Around town, or... the airport? I've waited years for somebody to say airport.":"","tom|I'll be back before you know it. Go home and listen to your mom.":"","tom|Rose, I'll see what I can do about the palm tree.":"","sal|Airport. Love it. We'll be there in twenty minutes. Or two hours. Nobody knows.":"","tnb|Go. Hug the girls for me. I'll be right here, pot-sitive.":"","tom|Downtown LA. Seventy-two and sunny. It's always seventy-two and sunny.":"","grace|Tata! You're BACK! AGAIN!":"","grace|Tata, you're leaving AGAIN? You JUST got here!":"","rose|...That's ALMOST a palm tree.":""});
